01:02:27,096 --> 01:02:33,096
Perlman began working on the screenplay in 2009.

17
01:06:21,290 --> 01:06:27,290
Producer Kevin Feige first publicly mentioned Guardians of the Galaxy as a potential film in 2010 and
Marvel Studios announced it was in active development at the July 2012 San Diego Comic-Con.

18
01:10:15,483 --> 01:10:21,483
Gunn was hired to write and direct the film that September.

19
01:14:09,677 --> 01:14:15,677
In February 2013, Pratt was hired to play Peter Quill / Star-Lord, and
the supporting cast members were subsequently confirmed.

20
01:18:03,870 --> 01:18:09,870
Principal photography began in July 2013 at Shepperton Studios in England, with
filming continuing in London before wrapping in October 2013.

21
01:21:58,064 --> 01:22:04,064
In addition to an original score by Tyler Bates, the soundtrack includes
several popular songs from the 1960s and 1970s chosen by Gunn.

22
01:25:52,258 --> 01:25:58,258
Post-production was completed on July 7, 2014.

23
01:29:46,451 --> 01:29:52,451
Guardians of the Galaxy premiered at the Dolby Theatre in Hollywood, Los Angeles, on July 21, 2014, and
was theatrically released in the United States on August 1 as part of Phase Two of the MCU.

24
01:33:40,645 --> 01:33:46,645
It was a critical and commercial success, grossing $773.3 million
worldwide and became the third-highest-grossing film of 2014.

25
01:37:34,838 --> 01:37:40,838
It was praised for its screenplay, direction, acting, humor,
soundtrack, visual effects and action sequences.

26
01:41:29,032 --> 01:41:35,032
It was nominated for two awards at the 87th Academy
Awards, and received numerous other accolades.

